<title>USA: Dialogic says names Thomas Amato CFO.</title>
<headline>Dialogic says names Thomas Amato CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dialogic Corp said Monday Thomas Amato will become its new vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Amato will succeed Edward Jordan. The company said Jordan will be pursuing other interests.</p>
<p>The company said the position is effective May 27.</p>
<p>The company said Amato was most recently senior vice president and chief financial officer of Symbol Technologies Inc.  </p>
<p>The comany said Jordan resigned from his position.</p>
